%% Diagram source: docs/diagram/event-flow.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  participant R as PresenceRuntime consumer
  participant B as Process-local event bus
  participant P as Generic producer
  participant A as pi-subagent producer
  participant V as Strict validator
  participant S as Retained state and fence
  participant U as Presentation
  participant C as cmux

  R->>B: session start: ready v1 consumer advertisement + capabilities
  Note over R,P: Advertisement is passive capability discovery only,<br/>not a replay request.
  Note over P: Capability detection is diagnostic/recommended,<br/>not a mandatory update/remove gate.
  R->>B: ready v1 consumer-less replay/discovery request
  B->>P: matching consumer-less request
  P->>B: retained update v1, fresh sequence, attention none
  B->>R: update v1
  R->>V: validate object, session, shared fence
  V->>S: replace state and advance fence
  S->>U: current retained states
  U->>C: deterministic status / progress / attention

  P->>B: external consumer-less ready request
  B->>R: matching replay/discovery request
  R->>B: ready v1 consumer advertisement response
  R->>B: retained local/todo update, fresh sequence, attention none
  Note over R,P: Consumer advertisement response and replay occur only<br/>for a consumer-less request, never for an advertisement.

  A->>B: update v1 (intentionally ungated)
  Note over A,B: pi-subagent does not wait for capabilities:<br/>old consumers retain update compatibility.
  B->>R: update v1
  R->>V: validate object, session, shared fence
  V->>S: replace state and advance fence
  S->>U: current retained states
  U->>C: deterministic status / progress / attention
  A->>B: remove v1 with higher sequence (intentionally ungated)
  B->>R: remove v1
  R->>V: validate object, session, shared fence
  V->>S: delete retained state, keep fence tombstone
  S->>U: recompute remaining state
  U->>C: clear exact status / reselect progress / meta
  Note over U,C: Remove creates no generic notification, flash, log, or feed.
  R->>S: session teardown cleanup
  R->>C: clear owned output
